Mobile keeps the plain pointing stick and has no reverse; five schemes lost to it. Duels are out for now. Hosting is Vultr, cost is egress not compute. ASSS ships no per-ship balance and no arena cap, so the roster is ours. Repel is hostile only.                                         
The fleet was designed, tuned to the original's numbers, and shipped: docs closed their questions, the roster went authentic, and the game ended up live and hardened on a Vultr box behind Caddy.                                                                                             
vectorwake went live and every real bug was found by playing it, never by a health check: dead combat, frozen bots, unfindable greens and flags, a stale bundle. The build moved to CI along the way.                                                                                          
